---
title: Investigation — architecture questions and project review
---
flowchart TD
    classDef human fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#8a6d3b,color:#000
    classDef role fill:#d9edf7,stroke:#31708f,color:#000
    classDef channel fill:#dff0d8,stroke:#3c763d,color:#000
    classDef stop fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#777,color:#000

    T1["An entry in .claude/problems.MD"]:::channel
    T2["A human architecture question:<br/>'should this be one crate or two?'"]:::human
    T3["A whole-project review:<br/>module structure, documentation,<br/>roadmap coherence, dependency edges"]:::human
    T4["A Coder stopped: the needed<br/>investigation was too large for that role"]:::role
    T5["A Milestone Reviewer finding<br/>that is not a defect"]:::role

    ARCH["Architect"]:::role
    GATHER["Gather evidence, read-only:<br/>read the code, grep, run the test suite,<br/>read the ADRs and the roadmap.<br/>Never edit source or tests to find out"]
    STATE["State what the problem actually is —<br/>often not what the report said it was"]
    OPTS["Lay out the real options,<br/>including 'do nothing', with the cost of each"]
    REC["Recommend one, and say why the others lose"]

    WRITE["Write the entry in .claude/investigations.MD:<br/>problem, evidence with file:line citations,<br/>options, recommendation, what to do next.<br/>An investigation that does not say<br/>what to do next is not finished"]
    INV[".claude/investigations.MD"]:::channel

    CLOSES{"Does it close a .claude/problems.MD entry?"}
    MARK["Mark that entry resolved and point it<br/>at the investigation. Never delete it —<br/>the record of what was wrong is the point"]
    NEWPROB["Uncovered something else on the way?<br/>New numbered entry in .claude/problems.MD"]:::channel

    KIND{"What does the recommendation require?"}
    DOC["Architect does it: an ADR recording the<br/>decision, roadmap prose, CLAUDE.md,<br/>a crate README, a role definition"]:::role
    CODE["Task writer turns it into .claude/task.MD<br/>— see agent-flow-milestone-planning.mmd"]:::role
    NOTHING["Recommendation is 'leave it'.<br/>The investigation is still the deliverable:<br/>next time the question is already answered"]:::stop
    HUMAN["Human decides and commits"]:::human

    T1 --> ARCH
    T2 --> ARCH
    T3 --> ARCH
    T4 --> ARCH
    T5 --> ARCH
    ARCH --> GATHER --> STATE --> OPTS --> REC --> WRITE --> INV --> CLOSES
    CLOSES -- yes --> MARK --> KIND
    CLOSES -- no --> KIND
    GATHER --> NEWPROB
    KIND -- "prose or a decision" --> DOC --> HUMAN
    KIND -- "a change to code or tests" --> CODE --> HUMAN
    KIND -- "no action" --> NOTHING